1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,550
Your RAG system didn't retrieve
the right passage.

2
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:06,450
Is it the index, or the embeddings?

3
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:10,825
Run the same query with exact,
brute-force search.

4
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:16,275
If exact search finds it and your index
doesn't, the index is the problem.

5
00:00:16,575 --> 00:00:21,175
Its search settings are too low, or a
selective filter collapsed recall.

6
00:00:21,783 --> 00:00:24,608
If neither finds it, it's the embeddings.

7
00:00:24,908 --> 00:00:28,208
Try keyword search, query
rewriting, or HyDE.

8
00:00:29,217 --> 00:00:32,267
The full debugging method is on vidyal.ai.
